{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trooops is a puzzle-tactics roguelite deckbuilder where you command a bizarre crew in a grid-based combat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699510/extras/46c08852f7b8c4679056a885403d403d.poster.avif?t=1774354150\" width=780 height=408 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699510/extras/46c08852f7b8c4679056a885403d403d.webm?t=1774354150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699510/extras/46c08852f7b8c4679056a885403d403d.mp4?t=1774354150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Rearrange your soldiers into deadly formations to protect your ship at all costs. A thoughtful match-3 twist to find the perfect attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sacrifice trooops to survive devilish attacks, or see your boat slowly sinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699510/extras/1a0addba276422376a63cb38baab587e.poster.avif?t=1774354150\" width=780 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699510/extras/1a0addba276422376a63cb38baab587e.webm?t=1774354150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699510/extras/1a0addba276422376a63cb38baab587e.mp4?t=1774354150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train your crew, upgrade their gear, recruit unique castways to face ever-shifting creatures combat.\u00a0<br>Board enemy ships, find hidden treasures, and reach unknown shores as you combat across a procedurally generated archipelago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragrap